{"ref":"BDB, מִלּוֹא","hw":"מִלּוֹא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִלּוֹא</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. (</strong>Thes ‘<em>fill</em>’ of earth, earthwork, but v. GFM <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:6\" href=\"/Judges.9.6\">Ju 9:6</a><strong>)</strong> Schwally<sup>ZMG lii (1898), 137</sup> cp. Assyrian <em>mulû</em> = <em>earthwork, mound, terrace</em>, Dl <sup>411</sup> M-A <sup>544</sup>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית מִלּוֹא</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:6\" href=\"/Judges.9.6\">Ju 9:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעֲלֵי שְׁכֶם</span>) so v <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:20\" href=\"/Judges.9.20\">20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; near Shechem, site unknown; 𝔊 οἶκος Βηθμααλων.<br><strong>2.</strong>  citadel in Jerus. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמִּלּוֹא</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.9\">2 S 5:9</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.15\">1 K 9:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.27\">11:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.8\">1 Ch 11:8</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.5\">2 Ch 32:5</a>. 𝔊 usually ἡ ἄκρα (A <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.15\">1 K 9:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.24\">24</a> also Μελω).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית מִלֹּא</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.21\">2 K 12:21</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">הַיֹּרֵד סִלָּא</span>) dub.; = <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.2\">2</a>? 𝔊 οἴκῳ Μααλω.","next":"BDB, מִלֵּאת","prev":"BDB, מִלּוּא"}